---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Figure from '../components/Figure.astro';
import { about, principles } from '../data/product';
import founderPhoto from '../assets/images/andrew-brink.png';
// Copy from the original lockstep.uk site. Founder story written by Andrew.
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Lockstep is designed for people who want to stay in control of gambling without being told what that control must look like."
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="About Lockstep" title="What is Lockstep">
    {about.paragraphs.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}
  </PageHero>

  <section class="section section--surface" id="philosophy" aria-labelledby="principles-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stack reveal principles-head">
        <h2 id="principles-heading">Philosophy &amp; principles</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Lockstep is built around a small set of principles that guide every design decision.
          They keep us focused on what matters most: real support, real progress, and real choice.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ol class="principles">
        {principles.map((item, i) => (
          <li class="principle reveal">
            <span class="principle__num" aria-hidden="true">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <h3>{item.title}</h3>
            <p class="principle__text">{item.text}</p>
            <p>{item.detail}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="founder-heading">
    <div class="container founder reveal">
      <Figure
        src={founderPhoto}
        class="founder__photo"
        alt="Andrew Brink, founder of Lockstep"
        ratio="1"
        sizes="18rem"
      />
      <div class="stack">
        <h2 id="founder-heading">Meet the founder</h2>
        <p><strong>Andrew Brink</strong>, Founder</p>
        <p>
          Like a lot of students, I started gambling casually at university. It began with the
          odd sports bet with friends or a late trip to the casino after a night out, but over
          time I noticed it taking up more of my money, time and headspace than I wanted, so I
          went looking for something to help me keep it in check. What I found was reactive
          support designed for people already in crisis, with a one-size-fits-all approach. It
          asked for a commitment I wasn't ready to make: to see myself as someone in crisis and
          never gamble again.
        </p>
        <p>
          I attended a virtual GA meeting at 19 and left feeling more out of place than when I
          arrived. The stories I heard were worlds away from my own. Many people had spent
          decades in recovery, and their experiences had little in common with the app-based
          gambling I knew. Claiming to have a gambling problem after losing £200 felt like a lie
          next to what they'd been through, and being told the only answer was to never gamble
          again felt like a huge leap. I didn't need a dramatic intervention. I needed something
          relevant, private and practical, and people going through similar circumstances to
          talk to.
        </p>
        <p>
          Lockstep is what I wish I'd had back then: free, private, judgement-free support that
          meets you where you are. You decide what control looks like for you, and you'll find
          practical tools, real alternatives and people who understand what you're going
          through. Wherever you are with gambling, you don't have to figure it out alone.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .principles-head {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .principles {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .principles {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-lg) var(--space-xl);
    }
  }

  .principle {
    max-width: none;
    padding-top: var(--space-sm);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--color-green);
  }

  .principle__num {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xs);
    color: var(--color-emerald);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .principle p {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xs);
  }

  .principle__text {
    color: var(--color-green);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .founder {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .founder :global(.founder__photo) {
    max-width: 18rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .founder {
      grid-template-columns: 18rem 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
